      "uncited_sentences": [
        "The components of the general knowledge learning engine include a Knowledge Store (KS) which has four components: (i) Knowledge Graph (KG) that is initialized with base KB triples and gets updated over time, (ii) Relation-Entity Matrix (REM) used by the prediction model, (iii) Task Experience Store (TES) that stores the predictive performance of LiLi on past learned tasks, and (iv) Incomplete Feature DB (IFDB) that stores the frequency of incomplete paths involving entity-pairs for query relations."
      ]
